{
 "android-forms|DatePicker and TimePicker": {
  "summary": "A Plenix date or time picker on Android is Material 3’s date picker and time picker, kept native in behavior (the calendar and the clock dial, the switch to typed input, the locale’s first weekday and 12- or 24-hour clock, TalkBack and font scaling) and styled with the Plenix tokens: a dialog on the overlay surface with the 8 dp dialog radius and no tonal tint, DM Sans throughout, the chosen day and time in the primary action colors, today in the link color, and a range on the selected color. Material’s default is a tonal dialog with a 28 dp radius in the primary and secondary colors; Plenix keeps Material’s structure and replaces the look.",
  "variants": [
